{"id":192171619743867,"type":"artist","name":"Tindersticks","artist":null,"year":1991,"weight":13,"info":{"tags":["chamber pop","indie","alternative","indie rock","rock"],"country":"GB","begin":"1991","kind":"Group","similar":["Stuart A. Staples","Mercury Rev","Kim Deal","Richard Hawley","The Black Heart Procession","Thurston Moore","The The","King Hannah","Nick Cave","Arab Strap"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tindersticks_-Royal_Festival_Hall_-3_May_2008.jpg?width=500","bio":"Tindersticks es un grupo de rock formado en Nottingham, Reino Unido en 1991.\n\nEl sonido del grupo parte del pop independiente al que incorporan arreglos orquestales, de jazz y de soul. Su sello distintivo lo marcan la profunda voz de barítono de Stuart A. Staples, que le emparenta con los crooners clásicos, y las sofisticadas orquestaciones de Dickon Hinchliffe, que utiliza una amplia variedad de instrumentos que contribuyen al ecléctico sonido del grupo."},"works":[{"id":42229580582018,"type":"album","name":"Tindersticks","artist":"Tindersticks","year":1993,"weight":19,"yt":"P82ZvSiuc7s","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":59251635065665,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1993","rank":76,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":4389278164509,"name":"Music Genre Tree","rank":955,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":341,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":28572826268451,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Chamber Pop","rank":18,"scaruffi":7.5}],"n_lists":5}},{"id":192958660941622,"type":"album","name":"Tinderstick","artist":"Tindersticks","year":1995,"weight":6,"yt":"ESowizTFDNI","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":193686202599987,"type":"album","name":"Tindersticks [II]","artist":"Tindersticks","year":1995,"weight":5,"yt":"x-CLFf0ES50","s